stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Public
    Public --> Login: /login
    Public --> AppShell: Authenticated
    AppShell --> UncheckedRoute: before permission load
    UncheckedRoute --> LoadingPerms: route open
    LoadingPerms --> Authorized : permission match
    LoadingPerms --> Forbidden401 : no token
    LoadingPerms --> Forbidden403 : no permission
    Authorized --> Rendered : canMatch + canActivate
    Rendered --> UIHide: directive gating
    UIHide --> Rendered
